OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FRemaining
OL,6,Fcloudy through the evening as
OL,7,Fpersistent rain spreads southeast to
OL,8,Fall parts, turning heavy at times.
OL,9,FThis continues east overnight, largely
OL,10,Fclear by dawn to allow some clear
OL,11,Fspells.
OL,12,
OL,13,CWednesday:FBright spells and a
OL,14,Fscattering of showers at first.
OL,15,FBecoming dry through the afternoon
OL,16,Fwith increasing bright or sunny spells.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
