OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Thursday to Saturday:FDry
OL,6,Fstart Thursday, then a further band of
OL,7,Fcloud and rain passes southeast
OL,8,Fthrough the evening. Bright spells and
OL,9,Fa few showers Friday. Rain or showers
OL,10,Fon Saturday.
